/src/generated/prisma

# GoPartTime automation vault (raw session cookies, captures, browser profile - never commit)
.goparttime/

# Isolated feature workspaces (`git worktree add .worktrees/<branch>`) - each
# one is a full checkout of the tree, so leaving it untracked risks a
# `git add -A` sweeping thousands of duplicate source files into the repo.
.worktrees/

# Deploy transport (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md 5): `git bundle create statbot-main.bundle ...`
# ships code to the host, which has no GitHub credentials. It is a build
# artifact of the deploy, regenerated per run and deleted afterwards - never a
# repo file, and a binary blob that would bloat history if `git add -A` swept
# it in.
*.bundle
